  "body": "Some links were outdated/dead and some new info were missing, like Apple stating it won't support it (as well as many other APIs) for finger printing reasons, which, i believe, firefox endorsed as well but i couldn't find any official statement. Still, there bug tracker issues are closed as \"won't fix\".\r\n\r\nBluetooth API doesn't work anymore on Opera or any chromium-based browser but Edge and Chrome on desktop.\r\n\r\nMicrosoft Edge now supports API properly so i removed a dead status support link and simply saif it's supported\r\n\r\nAlso added a second iOs \"pollyfill app\" that's free.",
